The sentence ends: *"…so no platform skip is needed and the Linux leg #950 had to silence runs again."* The second clause contradicts the first and reads as unfinished (presumably intended: "…which is why the Linux-only runtime skip #950 added is now dropped" or similar). Rewording keeps the rationale readable for whoever debugs this fixture next.
"}

